### 0. 获取 CSRF
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/csrf
> {%
  client.global.set("csrfHeader", response.body.headerName);
  client.global.set("csrfToken", response.body.token);
%}

### 1. 注册
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json
{{csrfHeader}}: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "username": "student2026",
  "displayName": "测试学生",
  "email": "student2026@example.com",
  "password": "Passw0rd123",
  "college": "计算机学院",
  "className": "软工2401"
}

### 2. 登录
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
{{csrfHeader}}: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "username": "student2026",
  "password": "Passw0rd123"
}

### 3. 当前用户
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/me

### 4. 课程列表
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/courses
> {%
  if (response.body.length > 0) {
    client.global.set("courseId", response.body[0].id);
  }
%}

### 5. 登录后重新获取 CSRF
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/csrf
> {%
  client.global.set("csrfHeader", response.body.headerName);
  client.global.set("csrfToken", response.body.token);
%}

### 6. 加入课程
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/courses/{{courseId}}/join
{{csrfHeader}}: {{csrfToken}}